  targetFormatsHtml: "Supported: openEHR OPT/OPT2, Web Template, JSON Schema, XML Schema (XSD), ADL, free-form templates, or a GitHub .t.json (archetypes fetched from the same repo).<br>Choose a target and a default context map together. \u25BE also offers file, URL, GitHub, and non-destructive refresh.",
