  scriptFormatsAria: "Conversion script formats",
  scriptFormatsHtml: "Mapping preview interprets the mapping without generating a script. Conversion scripts (so far): TypeScript, Java, Handlebars, XQuery, and Go Template. TypeScript, Handlebars, Go Template, and XQuery also run in Conversion Test Run. Java generates an Archie class but does not execute in the web app. The desktop app can add another language with --language-plugin. For openEHR targets, JSON vs XML instance chooses how XQuery serializes the composition.<br>Download on the script editor saves the generated script. Imports in that script open the helper or library source. The overlay Download on Conversion Test Run saves that instance.",
